config BR2_PACKAGE_SD_EVENT_SHIM
	bool "sd-event-shim"
	depends on BR2_TOOLCHAIN_HAS_THREADS
	help
	  Mira's own implementation of the sd-event subset that
	  flutter-pi needs, installed as libsystemd.

	  flutter-pi requires libsystemd, but Buildroot only builds
	  systemd when systemd is also init - and Mira is a BusyBox-init
	  appliance that boots in two seconds. flutter-pi uses sd-event
	  in 103 places and sd-bus in none, so Mira supplies the event
	  loop rather than adopting systemd or carrying a large patch.

	  This is not systemd and provides nothing but sd-event.

comment "sd-event-shim needs a toolchain w/ threads"
	depends on !BR2_TOOLCHAIN_HAS_THREADS
